msgid ""
"[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token[quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token]`\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Both ID and access tokens are fetched from the OIDC provider as part of the authorization code flow. ID token is always verified on every user request as the primary token which is used to represent the principal and extract the roles. Access token is not verified by default since it is meant to be propagated to the downstream services. The verification of the access token should be enabled if it is injected as a JWT token. Access tokens obtained as part of the code flow will always be verified if `quarkus.oidc.roles.source` property is set to `accesstoken` which means the authorization decision will be based on the roles extracted from the access token. Bearer access tokens are always verified.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC_AUTHENTICATION_VERIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token[quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token]`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token[quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token]`"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token[quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token]`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Both ID and access tokens are fetched from the OIDC provider as part of the authorization code flow. ID token is always verified on every user request as the primary token which is used to represent the principal and extract the roles. Access token is not verified by default since it is meant to be propagated to the downstream services. The verification of the access token should be enabled if it is injected as a JWT token. Access tokens obtained as part of the code flow will always be verified if `quarkus.oidc.roles.source` property is set to `accesstoken` which means the authorization decision will be based on the roles extracted from the access token. Bearer access tokens are always verified."
msgstr "Tanto el token de identificación como el token de acceso se obtienen del proveedor OIDC como parte del flujo de código de autorización. El token de identificación se verifica siempre en cada solicitud del usuario como el token principal, que se utiliza para representar al principal y extraer los roles. El token de acceso no se verifica de forma predeterminada, ya que está destinado a propagarse a los servicios posteriores. La verificación del token de acceso debe habilitarse si se inyecta como un token JWT. Los tokens de acceso obtenidos como parte del flujo de código siempre se verificarán si la propiedad ` `quarkus.oidc.roles.source` ` se establece en ``accesstoken`` , lo que significa que la decisión de autorización se basará en los roles extraídos del token de acceso. Los tokens de acceso de tipo «bearer» siempre se verifican."

